
## Useful Git Log Commands

- Normal:

    git log

- Short:

    git log --oneline

- Graph:

    git log --oneline --graph --all

- This can help me visualise branches.

- Example:

    * a123 Add login
    * b456 Add database
    |\
    | * c789 Experimental feature
    |/
    * d012 Initial project

